                <pb facs="0357" n="1557" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54v07p2/pg1557"/>

                <head>No. 702<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>On July 9 the Second Conference of the Socialist Unity Party of the German
                    Democratic Republic convened in Berlin for four days of meetings. In addition to
                    the documentation presented below on the proceedings at this conference, a
                    complete record of the meetings is contained in <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Protokoll der II. Parteikonferenz</hi>. Excerpts of the record are also
                    printed in Ulbricht’s <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Zu Fragen der Parteiarbeit</hi>, pages 327–357, and <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Die Entwicklung des volksdemokratischen Staates</hi>,
                    pages 307–322, as well as in <hi rendition="#italic">Dokumente der SED</hi>, volume IV, pages 70–79.</p>
            </div>
